@startuml
title Related telemetry retrieval for focused imagery
' Traces: OMCT-C11-L2-03.01
participant "Imagery View" as View
participant "Focused Image" as Image
participant "Related Telemetry Service" as Related
participant "Telemetry Gateway" as Telemetry

Image -> View: focusChanged(imageTime)
activate View
View -> Related: resolveRelatedSources(metadata)
activate Related
Related --> View: related historical telemetry sources
deactivate Related
loop each related source
    View -> Telemetry: requestLatestAtOrBefore(source, imageTime)
    activate Telemetry
    Telemetry --> View: related value
    deactivate Telemetry
end
View -> Related: exposeValues(relatedValues)
activate Related
Related --> View: values exposed
deactivate Related
View --> Image: related telemetry refreshed
deactivate View
@enduml
